{
  "_comment": [
    "Scenario: UC-01 fatigue/drowsiness — long friend drive.",
    "Design: drowsiness ramps none→weak→moderate over the first 42% of the route.",
    "At fraction 0.42, with default hyperparameters (proposal_threshold=medium →",
    "proposalCut=3.0) and fatigue_level=medium, the first tick with drowsiness=moderate",
    "produces damped=3.1 ≥ proposalCut=3.0, rest reachable → R3 REST_PROPOSAL fires.",
    "The run then pauses, ensuring exactly ONE R3 tick.",
    "",
    "Blend derivation at trigger tick (fraction ≥ 0.42):",
    "  drowsiness=moderate(2), fatigue=medium(1), drive=moderate(ord=2 per ORD table)",
    "  signal=sustained(2), persistence_req=medium(1), wD=wF=medium(1)",
    "  blend = 2*(0.5+0.25) + 1*(0.2) + 2*0.4 = 1.5+0.2+0.8 = 2.5",
    "  shortfall = max(0,(1+1)-2)=0, persistenceLift=(2-1)*0.6=0.6",
    "  damped = 2.5+0.6 = 3.1 ≥ proposalCut(3.0) → R3 ✓",
    "",
    "initial_state uses fatigue_level='medium' (not 'low') because with fatigue=low",
    "and default hyperparameters, damped=2.9 < proposalCut=3.0 and R3 never fires."
  ],
